ding-3","children":"The problem"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600","children":"Directory sites force seekers to cold-call strangers. Lead-gen platforms sell the same lead to five providers in a race to the bottom. Neither side gets accountability, transparent pricing, or dispute recourse."}],"$L1f"]}],"$L20",null,"$L21"]}],"$L22"]}]}]]}],"$L23"]
